**This is not an open source licence.** It does not meet the Open Source
Definition and it is not a free software licence. The source is published so
that it can be read, studied and checked, not so that it can be reused.
Calling it "open source with restrictions" would be dishonest, so it is not
called that anywhere in this repository.

It states its terms plainly so that nobody has to guess.


1. WHY THIS SOURCE IS PUBLISHED

tokenstat's central claim is about what happens to your data: what is read,
what is kept, and what may leave your machine. A claim like that is worth
nothing if nobody can check it. Every line that touches your data is published
so that anyone can read it and verify the claim for themselves.

Trust, and verify. That is the whole of the intent, and the permissions below
are scoped to exactly that.


2. WHAT THIS COVERS

This licence covers everything in this repository: `crates/`, `apps/`,
`xtask/`, `scripts/`, `fixtures/`, the documentation, and any build produced
from them.

Third-party dependencies keep their own licences. Third-party trademarks and
logos included here, including those under `apps/mac/Resources/`, belong to
their owners and are not licensed by this document. See TRADEMARK.md.


